# GMS's mark and its use are one beat apart; here they happen together, so it is
# a Final Attack.
name: "Night Lord's Mark"
description:
  "Further enhances the assassin's mark, increasing the probability of "
  "leaving a mark, the damage, and the number of throwing stars."
kind: SKILL_KIND_PASSIVE
